abstract: "CARTOGRAFFECT® v2.1.0 stratified Research Compendium: Strate 0 unites six-prover formal verification (Lean 4.35.0, Rocq 9.1.0, Agda 2.9.0, Dafny 4.11.0, SMT-LIB/Z3 5.3.3, TLA+/TLC 2.19; 130/130 verified theorems, 132/132 Dafny/TLA+ lemmas/predicates, 2/2 Z3 AUX, 11/11 evaluation blocks, 0 sorry, 0 custom axioms), an isomorphic exact Python predictive engine, and the canonical theoretical manuscript (176 affective states across Z in {0,...,7}, predictions P1-P5). Strate 1 provides subordinate exploratory extensions for computational lexical projection/GRID-CPM challenges (extensions/lexicon/, including 36/36 verified Lean 4 theorems with 0 sorry) and in silico Active Inference pymdp/JAX/NumPyro simulations (extensions/in_silico/)."
